---
import ArrowRightIcon from "@/assets/arrow-right.svg";
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden px-6">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="h-[600px] w-[600px] rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 blur-3xl dark:bg-indigo-500/5" />
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-string sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
      Controla tus
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">finanzas personales</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-string-muted sm:text-xl">
      Open PRP es tu centro de gestión financiera personal. Transacciones, tarjetas, plazos, suscripciones, despensa y más, todo en un solo lugar.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="/app"
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25 transition-all hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-indigo-500/30 hover:scale-105 active:scale-100"
      >
        Comenzar gratis
        <ArrowRightIcon class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="#features"
        class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-panel px-8 py-4 text-lg font-medium text-string transition-colors hover:bg-nav-hover"
      >
        Ver más
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
